Description:
Nigeria, small group of adult females standing beside track. Females carrying bundles of leaves and reeds [?] on heads. Wearing bundles of leaves hanging from waist-bands. Savanna setting, hill in distance.
Medium:  
Gelatin silver print.;

Nigeria, adult male "surgeon-barber" cupping foot of second adult male. Surgeon sharpening "razor" on "bone" [?]. Row of cupping horns on ground at left. Horn in place on foot of patient. Bowl on ground between two males. Surgeon wearing gown and turban, patient wearing trousers, shirt, cap. Both males sitting on ground outdoors, beneath tree. Rural setting.
Medium:  
Gelatin silver print.;

Study of pair of Nigerian Bini religious bronze figures. Appear to represent adults, female on left. Female represented as having domes hair-style, scarification on torso, wearing personal-ornaments, holding small object. Other figure represented as wearing garment covering torso, personal-ornaments, head-dress, scarification on face. Rear view. Outdoor setting.
Plain backdrop.
Medium: Gelatin silver print.;

Nigeria, small group of adult females standing beside track. Females carrying bundles of leaves and reeds [?] on heads. Wearing bundles of leaves hanging from waist-bands. Savanna setting, hill in distance.
Medium:  
Gelatin silver print.;

Picture of an Ekpo mask. Round face with open mouth. Appears to be made of wood.
Plain backdrop.
Medium: Gelatin silver print.;

Model shrimping basket, fish trap made of leaf (raffia).
Register 1960
Split palm, conical shrimp basket.;

Af1928,0711.23a is hand-sewn to Af1928,0711.23b.
a. Single length of hand plain woven bleach white cotton embellished with dyed blue cotton supplementary weft decoration. The pattern consists of a series of alternating white and blue diamonds. The cloth is finished by a fringe of unworked warps.
b. Single length of plain woven bleached white cotton embellished with dyed blue cotton supplementary weft decoration. The pattern consists of four warp chains of diamonds. The pattern is accentuated by blue dashes at regular intervals. The cloth is finished by a fringe of unworked warps.;

Af1928,0711.23a is hand-sewn to Af1928,0711.23b.
a. Single length of hand plain woven bleach white cotton embellished with dyed blue cotton supplementary weft decoration. The pattern consists of a series of alternating white and blue diamonds. The cloth is finished by a fringe of unworked warps.
b. Single length of plain woven bleached white cotton embellished with dyed blue cotton supplementary weft decoration. The pattern consists of four warp chains of diamonds. The pattern is accentuated by blue dashes at regular intervals. The cloth is finished by a fringe of unworked warps.;

